Data sources
------------

- Preset shape geometry (crates/core-model/src/geometry/presets/): converted from presetShapeDefinitions.xml of
  ECMA-376 Part 1 (Office Open XML File Formats), (c) Ecma International; Ecma's copyright notice permits copies
  and derivative works that assist in implementing the standard.
- PowerPoint table style fixture (crates/fmt-pptx/src/tablestyle_powerpoint.xml): six a:tblStyle definitions as
  PowerPoint writes them, taken from the extraction published with Dewiride PPTX Studio (Apache License 2.0) and
  cross-checked with LibreOffice's predefined-table-styles.cxx (Mozilla Public License 2.0, The Document
  Foundation). The 74 built-in table style GUIDs are identifiers published by Microsoft; the looks Rusuite
  generates from them are its own.

Android and iOS apps
--------------------

The Android apps (Gradle projects under apps/*/src-tauri/gen/android and the Kotlin plugin in
crates/tauri-plugin-rusuite-mobile) additionally include, all under the Apache License 2.0 (Google / JetBrains):
- AndroidX: appcompat 1.7.1, core-ktx 1.9.0, activity-ktx 1.10.1, webkit 1.14.0, lifecycle-process 2.10.0
- Material Components for Android 1.12.0
- Kotlin standard library (Kotlin Gradle plugin 2.2.10); build only: Android Gradle plugin 9.3.1
- The Tauri Android/iOS runtime (tauri-android, Tauri Swift API), MIT or Apache-2.0, as for the Rust crates
The iOS apps use no CocoaPods or other Swift packages besides the Tauri Swift API; Apple system frameworks are
not redistributed.

